/Title (A workshop on Fraud Risk Analysis was conducted on November 16, 2025, to provide students with insights into identifying and preventing financial frauds in organizations. The session highlighted key risk areas, common fraud patterns, and the importance of strong internal controls. Through practical examples and interactive discussions, students gained a better understanding of how fraud risks are assessed and managed in real-world scenarios. The workshop was informative and engaging, helping participants develop awareness and critical thinking skills in the field of risk management.)
