/Title (A hands-on workshop on Power BI was conducted on November 15,2025 students to enhance their data analytics and visualization skills. The session provided practical exposure to creating interactive dashboards, reports, and deriving meaningful insights from data. Students actively participated in real-time exercises, gaining a deeper understanding of business intelligence tools and techniques. The workshop proved to be highly informative and skill-oriented, equipping students with essential competencies required in the corporate environment. It also encouraged analytical thinking and data-driven decision-making among the participants.)
