/Title (Festivals embody the spirit of togetherness, joy, and cultural harmony. Diwali, the festival of lights, sweets, and colors, was celebrated on October 16, 2025, by the Cultural Committee at the college. Students and staff enthusiastically participated in the celebrations by creating rangoli, decorating the seminar hall, lighting diyas, and exchanging sweets with one another. The celebration filled the campus of Swayam Siddhi Mitra Sangh with a vibrant and festive atmosphere, fostering unity and happiness among all. Wishing everyone a joyful and prosperous Diwali!)
